### Create a new society (requires SuperAdmin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/society
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhNTdiZWM5MjU3ODM3NWNmZjNiZWIzMyIsInJvbGUiOiJTdXBlckFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg0OTA0Nzk4LCJleHAiOjE3ODU1MDk1OTh9.BdIy2zPkrcWk_saGaeBQxj2ZOAXIqmJEIvGo5ttmD1A

{
  "name": "Asmita Mogra Co-Op Housing Society",
  "address": "123 Test Street",
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "registrationNumber": "REG12345"
}

### Get all societies (requires SuperAdmin token)
